  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "雞腿飯ê滋味"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：田美瑜&nbsp;</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">歇睏日阮規家伙仔去運動中心拍羽毛球，運動了後腹肚iau-sà-sà，緊走去新北投ê一間餐廳食飯。雖bóng已經暗時7點半--ah，餐廳iáu是人kheh-kheh。Tsit間店自阮翁婿細漢ê時就開始營業，壁堵phú-phú ê色緻，講出伊規年thàng天，頭家認真滿足逐家腹肚ê心聲。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">餐廳ê雞腿飯tsiânn有特色，伊ê紅茶mā不止仔好lim。雞腿飯送--來ê時，kan-ta看著雞腿ê色緻，就tsiânn滿足--ah。咖啡色koh小可仔金金，看起來就真好食款。雞腿皮食--起-來脆脆，雞腿肉甜koh芳，bē輸大飯店ê總舖師，逐工食mā bē厭siān。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tng當阮大腸告小腸ê時，細漢囝喙笑目笑講，雞腿飯是伊細漢時ê記持。聽--著ê時，心內有一種感動。論真想看māi，真正有影！話頭一開，兄弟兩人你一句我一句，開始講in細漢時，食雞腿飯ê趣味代。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">印象上深--ê，有一擺阮tī厝--裡，等翁婿買雞腿飯tńg--來。我無事無白開門出去排鞋仔，想bē到大漢囝suah無聲無sueh，kā門關--起-來。Tann tsit聲害--ah！兩歲外ê囡仔，根本無夠kuân，mā無法度開暗鎖。雖bóng kan-ta隔一个門，囡仔人無看著阿母，iáu是ē淡薄仔驚惶。等翁婿tńg--來ài點外鐘，姑不而將去揣奶母借錢。Hainnh！人若衰，pû仔看做菜瓜。奶母講歇睏日，lán tsit箍圍仔內，拍鎖匙ê店lóng歇睏，假使beh揣開鎖--ê，mā ài坐車30分鐘ê所在去蘆洲hia tsiah有。真正是火hua--ah！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">好佳哉，細漢囝拄仔好lim牛奶煞，leh tuh-ku。奶母tsiânn惜囡仔，liam-mi提手機仔khà電話hōo阮囝，安搭囡仔驚惶ê心情。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">時間就án-ne一分一秒過--去--looh！等「tang」一聲，電梯門拍--開，阮翁婿出現tī阮ê面頭前，逐家mā lóng輕鬆--起-來--ah！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">雞腿飯來--ah！阮ná享受雞腿脆脆芳芳ê好滋味，ná回想阮規家伙仔來食雞腿飯ê記持。心內有一種感動，原來雞腿飯ê內底，有摻真濟囡仔細漢時趣味ê記持。雞腿飯ê滋味，不止是好食，koh有我kap囝兒，對in一粒紅紅，捏kah tsit-má是kau-tshiâng大漢ê少年家ê心情，hōo阮sian講就bē siān，所致不管如何一定ài來交關。</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">#</b><span><span><b>生活ê藝術</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報334期，2022年1月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgkcK-sQ3kCU8isB7qUAX_FTgO1-06JLfmmMPF_-lezM3lgsHQGlc8qT07mxY6Fkd-f26rZuGn1U4G1Tzcbw_UBj1Kp0mMIzLuMCUUSpj6xe-JF8iYq2F_qSdJ82Vcy5uqHU-bjDibWwvYT1JKAj19v-G-pdzWptUybEn-FJUuZJo6DZ2fnVuzZEx6l6g=s1424\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgkcK-sQ3kCU8isB7qUAX_FTgO1-06JLfmmMPF_-lezM3lgsHQGlc8qT07mxY6Fkd-f26rZuGn1U4G1Tzcbw_UBj1Kp0mMIzLuMCUUSpj6xe-JF8iYq2F_qSdJ82Vcy5uqHU-bjDibWwvYT1JKAj19v-G-pdzWptUybEn-FJUuZJo6DZ2fnVuzZEx6l6g=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgYLhDM3IKFSuy4zZnEBsi_xQ3JJkb9-AOT4SKO2unsSdMsSiXFwMsfPmWQEWdIKliGIU2sI7a7jvLXOWYSo914qjm7sEQTaMD04LnRVRx5nMwYGsw9iP9rkgKkR3LpuNSawZQ3FlLjG7ciO2_ZxePnudkALYYRLPdXcBDIYhHg--YIN1IvM6zTgJA71A=s4300\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"4300\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgYLhDM3IKFSuy4zZnEBsi_xQ3JJkb9-AOT4SKO2unsSdMsSiXFwMsfPmWQEWdIKliGIU2sI7a7jvLXOWYSo914qjm7sEQTaMD04LnRVRx5nMwYGsw9iP9rkgKkR3LpuNSawZQ3FlLjG7ciO2_ZxePnudkALYYRLPdXcBDIYhHg--YIN1IvM6zTgJA71A=w640-h452\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div>"
